  "description": "Service Fabric readiness for Entity Framework contexts: each context must connect, a Firebird context must find every relation and column its model maps, and a context with migrations must have none pending (Eternet/Devs.Issues#2427).",
  "id": "Eternet.AspNetCore.ServiceFabric.EntityFrameworkCore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-26T21:22:42.66Z",
  "listed": true,
