  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 113747,
  "published": "2026-11-26T20:59:37.45Z",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.2: published with ServiceFabric 10.11.2, no changes of its own. 1.2.1: published with ServiceFabric 10.11.0 (1.2.0 was never published). 1.2.0: the application's background services start only once the instance is ready, so its jobs never run against a schema readiness has not verified (Eternet/Devs.Issues#2823). 1.1.2: a role with no schema in its search_path still verifies its schema-qualified relations. 1.1.0: a PostgreSQL context must find every relation and column its model maps, from EF migrations or reviewed scripts (Eternet/Devs.Issues#2777).",
